.nh
.TH "PB-TUNNEL-CONNECTOR-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-tunnel-connector-list - List tunnel connectors


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb tunnel connector list <tunnel> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List tunnel connectors

.PP
List connectors attached to one durable tunnel with cursor and limit pagination. Use the returned connector identity for drain or revoke.

.PP
Connectors attach an enrolled host to a durable tunnel. Drain stops new work while allowing existing work to wind down; revoke removes connector authority. Inspect connector state before replacing or removing one.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--cursor\fP=""
	continue a previous page

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print canonical JSON

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=100
	maximum results (1-200)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--ephemeral\fP[=false]
	use the temporary preview lifecycle

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-tunnel-connector(1)\fP
